// endpoint_update_question_draft.proto — UpdateQuestionDraft: one click on a
// standing question card. FEED section.
//
// THE DAEMON OWNS THE DRAFT. Which question the card shows and what each
// question has been given so far live daemon-side and ride the card as
// frontend.v1.FeedQuestionOpen, so the webapp's clicks and the editor's typed
// answer (agentrepl.v1.SubmitPromptAskAnswered) edit ONE record. There is no
// submit: the moment every question is answered the daemon delivers the batch
// itself. Success is "applied" — the card's new state arrives as the row's
// re-push.

